fig2sxd
------------------------------------------
The fig2sxd program converts files in XFig format into OpenOffice.org /
LibreOffice.org Draw format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.com/acfbuerger/fig2sxd

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.com/acfbuerger/fig2sxd/-/archive/v0.24/fig2sxd-v0.24.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack fig2sxd-0.24-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./fig2sxd-0.24-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/fig2sxd-0.24-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/fig2sxd-0.24-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(fig2sxd)
  /usr/bin/fig2sxd.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/fig2sxd.README
  /usr/share/doc/fig2sxd/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/fig2sxd/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/fig2sxd/changelog
  /usr/share/man/man1/fig2sxd.1.gz

